WEBVTT

00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:10,000
Hi, I'm Dr. Kevin Cutters, and this video is to invite you to my practitioner, Dr. Oli Newsletter series.

00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:18,000
I decided to do this series because a friend of mine said to me a while ago that,

00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:25,000
you know, if you pass away all the information that you have passes away with you, you need to share it with other people.

00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:30,000
I used to give seminars, and that was very draining.

00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:41,000
So I decided, well, why don't I just put it together a Newsletter series and then allow doctors to contact me if they need any extra help to share my knowledge with other people.

00:00:41,000 --> 00:00:50,000
Though I realize that there's a lot of doctors out there that know a whole lot more than I do, but there's probably not very many that practice the way I do.

00:00:50,000 --> 00:00:57,000
I graduated in 1986 from Northwestern car practice, thinking I was going to practice car practice the rest of my life. That was my passion.

00:00:57,000 --> 00:01:01,000
Well, God has a way to change your mind and change your purpose.

00:01:01,000 --> 00:01:08,000
We left car practice and went into full-time ministry doing some work done in Mexico for a period of time.

00:01:08,000 --> 00:01:13,000
Then came back to car practice, thinking, well, this is what I'm going to do again.

00:01:13,000 --> 00:01:17,000
And that's just not how it works out sometimes.

00:01:18,000 --> 00:01:31,000
God said, patient, my way, actually, a car practice patient who said that she had breast cancer and that I was her only hope to help her from a nutritional standpoint because she chose not to do the chemo and radiation.

00:01:31,000 --> 00:01:36,000
I was like, well, this is beyond my school of practice. I don't know what you're asking me to do here.

00:01:36,000 --> 00:01:46,000
But that's when I started really digging into some nutritional, natural, integrative approaches to help these people that are very sick.

00:01:47,000 --> 00:01:51,000
And one thing you led to another were actually 100 things, led to 100 things.

00:01:51,000 --> 00:02:01,000
And I ended up leaving my car practice license and I only see cancer and lying patients helping them completely at an integrative level.

00:02:01,000 --> 00:02:06,000
That is a substitute for their current care, but as an addition.

00:02:06,000 --> 00:02:11,000
And I get doctors that call me on a weekly basis wanting help with patients.

00:02:11,000 --> 00:02:20,000
So I thought, well, let's put this together in a newsletter format so that I can share tidbits of information that you might help you in practice.

00:02:20,000 --> 00:02:34,000
Even if you have a pretty straight car practice, knowing some nutritional things or at least being able to steer people in a direction that could help them, I think is a wonderful thing that you could do.

00:02:35,000 --> 00:02:40,000
So understand signing up for this, you get a newsletter about every week or two weeks.

00:02:40,000 --> 00:02:44,000
I've never selling anything, so you don't have to worry about that.

00:02:44,000 --> 00:02:49,000
I don't have a practice bandage with Ferb. I don't have seminar. There's nothing to buy.

00:02:49,000 --> 00:02:55,000
So if you don't like it, unsubscribe. But if it's a blessing to you, then that's the whole idea.

00:02:55,000 --> 00:03:03,000
So I invite you to sign up and check them out and tell a friend and hopefully we can help everybody.

00:03:03,000 --> 00:03:07,000
So enjoy and I hope it's a blessing.

